OL,3,GNEWSAMan who killed dog walker should
OL,4,Abe deported, says judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Afghan refugee who killed a dog
OL,7,Fwalker and attacked two other people in
OL,8,Fa "frenzy of violence" has been given
OL,9,Fan indefinite hospital order and
OL,10,Frecommended for deportation.
OL,12,FDawood Safi, 28, stabbed Wayne
OL,13,FBroadhurst, 49, in the street during a
OL,14,Fseries of knife attacks which began at
OL,15,FSafi's home in Uxbridge, west London,
OL,16,Fon 27 October 2025, Southwark Crown
OL,17,FCourt heard.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
